{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been reduced to ashes, and only some rebels continue to fight.<br>Welcome to <strong><i>Cinderia</i></strong>, a Rogue-lite action game where dark fairy tales intertwine with fast-paced combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Witch's embers still smolder, and magic whispers never cease. She never foresaw that these powers would be seized by you and forged into weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daggers slice through darkness, cannons shatter foes, frost halts death itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your combat style \u2013 yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world was reduced to ashes, fate brought the rebels together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, there is only one goal\u2014to end the nightmare and make fate bow to their will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the desolate corners, a warm fire still awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stumbles, wounds, and failure\u2013 they are merely part of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Return, recover, and set forth once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes action rogue-lites thrilling? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you crave precise, satisfying strikes or explosive builds with wild synergies? Why choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master both combat and builds. Let skill combos become lethal art \u2013 but remember: Dodge enemy attacks. Survival fuels the stylish Action performance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;Embers&quot; and &quot;Skill Sets&quot; to modify adventurers' attack moves and skill mechanics during runs, gaining extraordinary combat abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine &quot;Relics&quot; and &quot;Items&quot; to enhance adventurers' in-run base stats and challenge various powerful enemies in the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring back strengthening resources to invest in the out-of-run skill tree, making your adventures more enduring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize everything available on the battlefield to fight, and you will discover unique fun</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3214610?t=1759329780","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3214610?t=1759329780","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/a42b59b7385b3b4e08b8cf9fed402c2276af7e70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759329780","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/a42b59b7385b3b4e08b8cf9fed402c2276af7e70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759329780","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>\u200bCinderia: Where Fairy Tales Burn to Ash</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A 2.5D action roguelite where combos and skills collide as you command!</strong></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/f1388a9fccec984f2ef908158a5908f9.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world has been reduced to ashes, and only some rebels continue to fight.<br>Welcome to <strong><i>Cinderia</i></strong>, a Rogue-lite action game where dark fairy tales intertwine with fast-paced combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/8085b9aa80f0aad5d0bd594fd3fda89e.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Witch's embers still smolder, and magic whispers never cease. She never foresaw that these powers would be seized by you and forged into weapons. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daggers slice through darkness, cannons shatter foes, frost halts death itself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your combat style \u2013 yours to define.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/345e0edc4fef5998339129c565b0efaa.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the world was reduced to ashes, fate brought the rebels together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, there is only one goal\u2014to end the nightmare and make fate bow to their will.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/185629da999af741e1724035bb5e6624.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the desolate corners, a warm fire still awaits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stumbles, wounds, and failure\u2013 they are merely part of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Return, recover, and set forth once more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.poster.avif?t=1759329780\" width=620 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.webm?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/extras/9cfbcf12e636c11c1f1cbee797e73761.mp4?t=1759329780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What makes action rogue-lites thrilling? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you crave precise, satisfying strikes or explosive builds with wild synergies? Why choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Master both combat and builds. Let skill combos become lethal art \u2013 but remember: Dodge enemy attacks. Survival fuels the stylish Action performance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use &quot;Embers&quot; and &quot;Skill Sets&quot; to modify adventurers' attack moves and skill mechanics during runs, gaining extraordinary combat abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine &quot;Relics&quot; and &quot;Items&quot; to enhance adventurers' in-run base stats and challenge various powerful enemies in the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring back strengthening resources to invest in the out-of-run skill tree, making your adventures more enduring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize everything available on the battlefield to fight, and you will discover unique fun</p></li></ul>","developers":["MyACG Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214610/db6b42f08dca140e2553f7afc66ba48821ef18e9/header.jpg?t=1759329780","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1520520626/6b009ce52778c2170b547c1a48329b00df21d9c7/1759328736/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759329777","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1520520626/6b009ce52778c2170b547c1a48329b00df21d9c7/1759328736/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759329777","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1520520626/6b009ce52778c2170b547c1a48329b00df21d9c7/1759328736/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759329777","id":257210091,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210091/movie480.mp4?t=1759329777","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210091/movie_max.mp4?t=1759329777"},"name":"Cinderia PV2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257210091/8333d13462d58994f4d080b8ac073cbf6c0eb7ae/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1759329777","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210091/movie480.webm?t=1759329777","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257210091/movie_max.webm?t=1759329777"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1382231774/4950df3958379f1500303ede75d016d419bb4e82/1758862331/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758872686","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3214610/1382231774/4950df3958379f1500303ede75d016d419bb4e82/1758862331/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758872686","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto